 Master’s degree in physics, computer science, or a closely related field;
 Strong interest in ML and motivation to make it interpretable and reliable;
 Knowledge of quantum physics and numerical methods for quantum systems or theory of deep learning is preferred;
 Good programming skills in Python;
 Proficient in spoken and written English;
 A team player who can communicate well across scientific fields and teams;
